      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "San Tan Valley was largely undeveloped desert until the early 2000s, when planned communities like Pecan Creek South and Archer Meadows began to spring up.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
