      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Tan_Valley%2C_Arizona",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Geographically, the town sits east of the San Tan Mountains within the Sonoran Desert, experiencing hot, arid summers and mild winters.",
